{"id":"07c3669c44551902","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ef-theorem.md","title":"EF定理","display":"thm-ef-theorem — EF定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ef-theorem","aliases":["29-thm-ef-theorem"],"display":"thm-ef-theorem — EF定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-ef-game]]","[[29-df-n-equivalence]]","[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 6.10, p.95, DjVu scan 110","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；等价陈述与归纳证明已核对"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ef-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ef-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ef-theorem — EF定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33e3bd9a5bf15557\" href=\"?note=33e3bd9a5bf15557\" title=\"29-df-n-equivalence\">29-df-n-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 6.10, p.95, DjVu scan 110"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；等价陈述与归纳证明已核对"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_k\">\\(\\equiv_k\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"33e3bd9a5bf15557\" href=\"?note=33e3bd9a5bf15557\" title=\"29-df-n-equivalence\">29-df-n-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\equiv_kB\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq k\\Rightarrow(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_k(A,B)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\equiv_kB\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq k\\Rightarrow(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a> 的历史入口。原书 Theorem 6.10 对有限关系词汇给出双界游戏刻画；本条输入结构有限，原子式一致性递归见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a>。不再通过尚未兼容核对的跨书部分同构定义取得结论。两个入口不计作两个独立数学结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"c5e364d61e491828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"33e3bd9a5bf15557","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-n-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","status":"resolved","id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","status":"resolved","id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$；$A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，见 [[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","a